    {href: "/low-key-vs-high-key-lighting", title: "Low-Key vs High-Key Lighting"}
  ]} />

  <CourseCTA text="Want to see how lighting decisions carry through into the grade — matching soft-lit and hard-lit footage in the same timeline? The full color grading workflow is inside the course." />

</Layout>
